
#=================================================================#
#  NAMED PARAM CHECKING -- Pure Ring Implementation               #
#  Replaces 1,566 IsXxxNamedParam() methods in stzList with       #
#  a single hash-lookup against an embedded keyword registry.     #
#=================================================================#

